<section class="vc-workflow-intro" aria-labelledby="catalog-intro-title"><div class="vc-workflow-icon"><i class="fa-solid fa-box-open"></i></div><div><span class="vc-section-kicker">PRODUCT WORKFLOW</span><h2 id="catalog-intro-title">Create an accurate listing, then send it for review</h2><p>Drafts stay private. Add genuine product photos and complete every detail before requesting admin approval.</p></div><ol class="vc-mini-steps" aria-label="Product publishing steps"><li><b>1</b><span>Save draft</span></li><li><b>2</b><span>Add images</span></li><li><b>3</b><span>Submit review</span></li><li><b>4</b><span>Publish after approval</span></li></ol></section>
<div class="vc-callout" role="note"><i class="fa-solid fa-shield-halved" aria-hidden="true"></i><span>Images must pass security scanning and an admin must approve the product before customers can see it.</span></div>
<div id="catalog-message" class="vc-callout mt-3" role="status" hidden></div>
<section class="vc-card mt-3" aria-label="Your products">
  <div class="vc-card-head"><div><h2>Your products</h2><span class="vc-help" id="catalog-count">Loading…</span></div><div class="vc-actions"><button type="button" class="vc-btn small" id="catalog-refresh">Refresh</button><button type="button" class="vc-btn small primary" id="catalog-new">Add product</button></div></div>
  <div class="vc-card-body"><div class="vc-toolbar"><div class="vc-search"><i class="fa-solid fa-magnifying-glass"></i><input id="catalog-search" type="search" placeholder="Search product or SKU" aria-label="Search your products"></div><select id="catalog-filter" class="vc-select" aria-label="Filter product status"><option value="">All statuses</option><option value="draft">Draft</option><option value="pending_review">Pending review</option><option value="changes_requested">Changes requested</option><option value="rejected">Rejected</option><option value="approved">Approved</option><option value="active">Active</option><option value="paused">Paused</option><option value="out_of_stock">Out of stock</option></select></div><div id="catalog-list" class="mt-3">Loading products…</div></div>
</section>

<section class="vc-card mt-3" id="catalog-editor" hidden aria-label="Product draft editor">
  <div class="vc-card-head"><h2 id="catalog-editor-title">New product draft</h2><button type="button" class="vc-btn small" id="catalog-close">Close editor</button></div>
  <div class="vc-card-body">
    <form id="catalog-form" class="vc-form-grid">
      <div class="vc-field full"><label for="cat-name">Product name <span class="vc-required" aria-hidden="true">*</span></label><input class="vc-input" id="cat-name" name="name" required minlength="3" maxlength="220" aria-describedby="cat-name-help"><small class="vc-help" id="cat-name-help">Use the name a customer would recognise. Avoid promotional claims.</small></div>
      <div class="vc-field"><label for="cat-sku">SKU</label><input class="vc-input" id="cat-sku" name="sku" required minlength="2" maxlength="100" pattern="[A-Za-z0-9._-]{2,100}"></div>
      <div class="vc-field"><label for="cat-state">Origin state or UT</label><select class="vc-select" id="cat-state" name="origin_state"><option value="">Choose state or UT</option><?php require __DIR__.'/../components/india-states-options.php'; ?></select></div>
      <div class="vc-field full"><label for="cat-short">Short description</label><textarea class="vc-textarea" id="cat-short" name="short_description" maxlength="500"></textarea></div>
      <div class="vc-field full"><label for="cat-description">Full description</label><textarea class="vc-textarea" id="cat-description" name="description" required minlength="40" maxlength="10000" placeholder="Describe material, technique, origin, dimensions, care and any handmade variation accurately."></textarea></div>
      <div class="vc-field"><label for="cat-material">Material</label><input class="vc-input" id="cat-material" name="material" maxlength="500"></div>
      <div class="vc-field"><label for="cat-technique">Craft technique</label><input class="vc-input" id="cat-technique" name="craft_technique" maxlength="300"></div>
      <div class="vc-field"><label for="cat-dimensions">Product dimensions</label><input class="vc-input" id="cat-dimensions" name="dimensions" maxlength="255"></div>
      <div class="vc-field"><label for="cat-care">Care instructions</label><input class="vc-input" id="cat-care" name="care_instructions" maxlength="3000"></div>
      <div class="vc-field"><label for="cat-mrp">MRP (₹)</label><input class="vc-input" id="cat-mrp" name="mrp" type="number" min="0.01" max="10000000" step="0.01" required></div>
      <div class="vc-field"><label for="cat-price">Selling price (₹)</label><input class="vc-input" id="cat-price" name="selling_price" type="number" min="0.01" max="10000000" step="0.01" required></div>
      <div class="vc-field"><label for="cat-gst">GST percentage</label><select class="vc-select" id="cat-gst" name="gst_percent" required><option value="0">0%</option><option value="5">5%</option><option value="12">12%</option><option value="18">18%</option><option value="28">28%</option></select></div>
      <div class="vc-field"><label for="cat-stock">Opening stock</label><input class="vc-input" id="cat-stock" name="stock" type="number" min="0" max="1000000" step="1" value="0" required><small class="vc-help" id="catalog-stock-note">For a new product only. Use Inventory for later changes.</small></div>
      <div class="vc-field"><label for="cat-weight">Packed weight (grams)</label><input class="vc-input" id="cat-weight" name="package_weight_grams" type="number" min="1" max="500000" step="1" required></div>
      <div class="vc-field"><label for="cat-days-min">Minimum processing days</label><input class="vc-input" id="cat-days-min" name="processing_min_days" type="number" min="0" max="90" step="1" value="1" required></div>
      <div class="vc-field"><label for="cat-days-max">Maximum processing days</label><input class="vc-input" id="cat-days-max" name="processing_max_days" type="number" min="0" max="90" step="1" value="3" required></div>
      <div class="vc-field full"><label class="vc-check"><input id="cat-attest" type="checkbox" required> I confirm these details are accurate and that I can provide evidence for every environmental or artisan claim.</label></div>
      <div class="vc-field full"><div class="vc-form-actions vc-form-actions-inline"><span class="vc-help">You can return and finish this draft later.</span><button type="submit" class="vc-btn primary"><i class="fa-solid fa-floppy-disk"></i>Save product draft</button></div></div>
    </form>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="vc-grid two mt-3" id="catalog-extras" hidden>
  <article class="vc-card"><div class="vc-card-head"><h2>Product images</h2></div><div class="vc-card-body"><p class="vc-help">Upload genuine product photos, up to 10 JPG, PNG or WebP files. Maximum 5 MB each. A pending scan is not approval.</p><div id="catalog-images"></div><form id="catalog-image-form" class="vc-form-grid mt-3"><div class="vc-field full"><label for="cat-image">Image</label><input class="vc-input" id="cat-image" name="image" type="file" accept="image/jpeg,image/png,image/webp" required></div><div class="vc-field full"><label for="cat-image-alt">Description for accessibility</label><input class="vc-input" id="cat-image-alt" name="alt_text" required minlength="3" maxlength="220"></div><div class="vc-field full"><button type="submit" class="vc-btn primary">Upload image</button></div></form></div></article>
  <article class="vc-card"><div class="vc-card-head"><h2>Variants and review</h2></div><div class="vc-card-body"><p class="vc-help">The default variant is created with a new product. Add another colour, size or format here while the product is a draft.</p><div id="catalog-variants"></div><form id="catalog-variant-form" class="vc-form-grid mt-3"><div class="vc-field"><label for="cat-variant-name">Variant name</label><input class="vc-input" id="cat-variant-name" name="name" required maxlength="180" placeholder="Blue / Medium"></div><div class="vc-field"><label for="cat-variant-sku">Variant SKU</label><input class="vc-input" id="cat-variant-sku" name="sku" required pattern="[A-Za-z0-9._-]{2,100}" maxlength="100"></div><div class="vc-field"><label for="cat-variant-stock">Opening stock</label><input class="vc-input" id="cat-variant-stock" name="stock" type="number" min="0" max="1000000" value="0" required></div><div class="vc-field"><label for="cat-variant-price">Price adjustment (₹)</label><input class="vc-input" id="cat-variant-price" name="price_adjustment" type="number" step="0.01" value="0" required></div><div class="vc-field full"><button type="submit" class="vc-btn">Add variant</button></div></form><div class="vc-form-actions"><button type="button" class="vc-btn primary" id="catalog-submit-review">Submit for admin review</button></div><p class="vc-help">Submission requires at least one image with a clean security scan. Admin approval is separate.</p></div></article>
</section>
